/* miniprogram/packages/3d-model/pages/viewer/viewer.wxss */
/* 手绘风格，复用全局 CSS 变量（app.wxss） */
.viewer-page {
  min-height: 100vh;
  background: var(--bg, #F1F6F0);
  color: var(--ink, #1E2621);
}

.header {
  padding: 24rpx 30rpx;
  background: rgba(252, 253, 251, 0.92);
  border-bottom: 3rpx solid var(--gray-line, #D5DED8);
  position: absolute;
  top: 0;
  left: 0;
  right: 0;
  z-index: 10;
}

.model-name {
  font-size: 36rpx;
  font-weight: 800;
  color: var(--ink, #1E2621);
}

.canvas-container {
  position: relative;
  width: 100%;
  height: 100vh;
}

.canvas-container model-viewer {
  display: block;
  width: 100%;
  height: 100%;
}

.controls {
  position: absolute;
  bottom: 240rpx;
  left: 50%;
  transform: translateX(-50%);
  background: var(--paper, #FCFDFB);
  border: 3rpx solid var(--line, #4A5852);
  padding: 12rpx 36rpx;
  border-radius: 40rpx;
  box-shadow: var(--sh-sm, 3rpx 3rpx 1rpx rgba(74, 88, 82, .34));
}

.hint {
  font-size: 24rpx;
  color: var(--ink-soft, #4A554E);
}

/* 加载中 */
.loading-container {
  position: absolute;
  top: 50%;
  left: 50%;
  transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  z-index: 20;
}

.loading-spinner {
  width: 80rpx;
  height: 80rpx;
  border: 6rpx solid var(--gray-line, #D5DED8);
  border-top: 6rpx solid var(--green-accent, #5FB894);
  border-radius: 50%;
  animation: spin 1s linear infinite;
  margin-bottom: 30rpx;
}

@keyframes spin {
  0% { transform: rotate(0deg); }
  100% { transform: rotate(360deg); }
}

.loading-text {
  font-size: 28rpx;
  color: var(--gray, #98A29B);
}

/* 下载卡片 */
.download-card {
  background: var(--paper, #FCFDFB);
  border: 4rpx solid var(--line, #4A5852);
  border-radius: 40rpx;
  box-shadow: var(--sh, 5rpx 5rpx 1rpx rgba(74, 88, 82, .42));
  padding: 50rpx 60rpx;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  width: 560rpx;
}

.download-title {
  font-size: 32rpx;
  font-weight: 800;
  color: var(--ink, #1E2621);
  margin-bottom: 30rpx;
}

.progress {
  width: 100%;
  height: 14rpx;
  background: var(--green-soft, #E8F5EE);
  border: 2rpx solid var(--gray-line, #D5DED8);
  border-radius: 8rpx;
  overflow: hidden;
  margin-bottom: 16rpx;
}

.progress-bar {
  height: 100%;
  background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--green, #8FD3A8), var(--green-accent, #5FB894));
  border-radius: 8rpx;
  transition: width 0.3s ease;
}

.progress-text {
  font-size: 30rpx;
  color: var(--green-deep, #3D9970);
  font-weight: 700;
  margin-bottom: 10rpx;
}

.download-hint {
  font-size: 22rpx;
  color: var(--gray, #98A29B);
}

/* 下载确认弹窗 */
.modal-mask {
  position: fixed;
  top: 0;
  left: 0;
  right: 0;
  bottom: 0;
  background: rgba(30, 38, 33, 0.45);
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  z-index: 100;
}

.modal-content {
  width: 600rpx;
  background: var(--paper, #FCFDFB);
  border: 4rpx solid var(--line, #4A5852);
  border-radius: 40rpx;
  box-shadow: var(--sh, 5rpx 5rpx 1rpx rgba(74, 88, 82, .42));
  padding: 50rpx 40rpx 40rpx;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
}

.modal-icon {
  width: 100rpx;
  height: 100rpx;
  border: 4rpx solid var(--line, #4A5852);
  border-radius: 32rpx 26rpx 34rpx 24rpx;
  background: var(--green, #8FD3A8);
  color: var(--ink, #1E2621);
  font-size: 36rpx;
  font-weight: 800;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  margin-bottom: 30rpx;
  box-shadow: var(--sh-sm, 3rpx 3rpx 1rpx rgba(74, 88, 82, .34));
}

.modal-title {
  font-size: 34rpx;
  font-weight: 800;
  color: var(--ink, #1E2621);
  margin-bottom: 16rpx;
}

.modal-desc {
  font-size: 26rpx;
  color: var(--ink-soft, #4A554E);
  text-align: center;
  line-height: 1.6;
  margin-bottom: 40rpx;
}

.modal-actions {
  display: flex;
  width: 100%;
  gap: 24rpx;
}

.btn-cancel,
.btn-confirm {
  flex: 1;
  height: 88rpx;
  border: 4rpx solid var(--line, #4A5852);
  border-radius: 32rpx 28rpx 34rpx 26rpx;
  font-size: 30rpx;
  font-weight: 700;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  box-shadow: var(--sh-sm, 3rpx 3rpx 1rpx rgba(74, 88, 82, .34));
  transition: transform .12s, box-shadow .12s;
}

.btn-cancel:active,
.btn-confirm:active {
  transform: translate(4rpx, 4rpx);
  box-shadow: 0 0 0 var(--ink, #1E2621);
}

.btn-cancel {
  background: var(--paper, #FCFDFB);
  color: var(--ink-soft, #4A554E);
}

.btn-confirm {
  background: var(--green-accent, #5FB894);
  color: #ffffff;
}

.btn-cancel::after,
.btn-confirm::after {
  border: none;
}

/* 底部信息面板 */
.info-panel {
  position: absolute;
  bottom: 40rpx;
  left: 30rpx;
  right: 30rpx;
  background: rgba(252, 253, 251, 0.92);
  border: 3rpx solid var(--line, #4A5852);
  border-radius: 30rpx 24rpx 32rpx 22rpx;
  box-shadow: var(--sh-sm, 3rpx 3rpx 1rpx rgba(74, 88, 82, .34));
  padding: 28rpx 32rpx;
  z-index: 10;
}

.info-item {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  margin-bottom: 16rpx;
}

.info-item:last-child {
  margin-bottom: 0;
}

.label {
  color: var(--gray, #98A29B);
  font-size: 26rpx;
}

.value {
  color: var(--ink, #1E2621);
  font-size: 26rpx;
  max-width: 420rpx;
  overflow: hidden;
  text-overflow: ellipsis;
  white-space: nowrap;
}
